        "created_at": "2013-10-25T19:28:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>An \"answer searching for a question\" is scarier because it is more open-ended and in applying a question to it we reveal more about ourselves than in answering a \"question without an answer\".</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
